      "image": "assets/images/237399/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss strawberries with ¼ cup sugar in a medium bowl until evenly coated; set aside until juices release from strawberries, 5 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XygYNohj9qCmmxBUd8z0DZ_luhU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237399-best-strawberry-lemonade-ever-DDMFS-Step-02-417-0c6b22e0b5ae45af8c537976387fac56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237399/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, bring 1 cup water to a boil in a small saucepan; add remaining ¾ cup sugar. Cook and stir until sugar is dissolved, about 5 minutes. Cool simple syrup to room temperature, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zwGC8zAS0TPr5HtVIKt1zbh0qWo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237399-best-strawberry-lemonade-ever-DDMFS-Step-03-418-f0f8044d757742cab598ee2c45d915b7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237399/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine remaining 6 cups water, ice, lemon juice, and simple syrup in a pitcher; stir in sweetened strawberries with juices.",
